		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Cunning and sorcerous ogre- demons with shaggy white hair, blue skin, and yellow eyes.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 glaive (near) +6 (1d10) or 1 spell +5, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fade (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Self. Become invisible for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hellfrost (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. All within near-sized cube extending from oni 3d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mist (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Self. Turn into mist that can fly double near. Lasts 2d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapeshift</strong>. In place of attacks, turn into any humanoid or back into original form.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
